---
import { icons } from '../lib/icons';
import { appIcons } from '../lib/apps';
import { site } from '../lib/site';

---

<section class="section" id="new">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="pill-new">DockHub 1.0 Milestone</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Native macOS support &amp; desktop parity.</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        DockHub 1.0 marks a major milestone: full cross-platform parity between Windows 10/11 (.NET 10) and macOS 15 Sequoia (Swift 6).
        Experience native floating panels, Web Widgets SDK 1.0, 30+ built-in interactive widgets, automated crash safety, and shared configuration.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="news">
      <article class="nw nw-wide reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-mac">
            <div class="mac-header">
              <span class="mac-dots"><i class="md-r"></i><i class="md-y"></i><i class="md-g"></i></span>
              <span class="mac-title">macOS 15 Sequoia · Swift 6</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mac-dock-preview">
              <span class="mdp-item" set:html={appIcons.browser} />
              <span class="mdp-item" set:html={appIcons.terminal} />
              <span class="mdp-item" set:html={appIcons.music} />
              <span class="mdp-sep"></span>
              <span class="mdp-w"><i style="--c:var(--c-blue)"></i>Calendar</span>
              <span class="mdp-w"><i style="--c:var(--c-green)"></i>AirDrop</span>
              <span class="mdp-w"><i style="--c:var(--c-orange)"></i>Shortcuts</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mac-badges">
              <span>AppKit &amp; SwiftUI</span>
              <span>Dock Concealment</span>
              <span>Zero Admin</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Built from the ground up for macOS.</h3>
          <p>
            Native Swift 6 architecture with strict concurrency, AppKit floating panels, and smooth spring animations.
            DockHub can accompany the macOS dock or automatically conceal it while active. Includes Mac-tailored widgets like
            Calendar with 1-click meeting join, AirDrop, Apple Shortcuts, and Bluetooth battery monitoring.
            Special thanks to <a href="https://github.com/farukolmez22" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@farukolmez22</a> for contributions and testing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw nw-wide reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-link">
            <span class="ml-url">github.com/you/widgets/tree/main/pomodoro</span>
            <span class="mt-btn">Install</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-auto">SDK 1.0 · API v2 · <b>Featured Community Widgets</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Web widgets &amp; SDK 1.0.</h3>
          <p>
            Build custom desktop widgets with standard HTML, CSS, and modern JavaScript without writing C# or Swift.
            Runs on WebView2 (Windows) and WKWebView (macOS) with safe network sandboxing, theme synchronization, and 1-click installation from GitHub or .dockwidget packages.{' '}
            <a href={site.sdkUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">SDK guide ›</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-max">
            <div class="mm-win"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="mm-gap"></div>
            <div class="mm-dock"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Upgraded to .NET 10 LTS.</h3>
          <p>Windows core upgraded to Microsoft .NET 10 LTS (supported through 2028). Built-in crash protection restarts the dock seamlessly; in any failure, the original Windows taskbar instantly returns with zero system alteration.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-widgets">
            <span style="--c:var(--c-orange)">Claude Code</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-green)">OpenAI Codex</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-blue)">Gemini CLI</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-yellow)">Todoist</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-pink)">Battery Gear</span>
            <span style="--c:var(--c-green)">GPU &amp; Ping</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>30+ widgets &amp; AI quotas.</h3>
          <p>Live tracking for Claude Code (5-hour and weekly), OpenAI Codex, and Gemini CLI right on your dock. Plus battery monitoring for Bluetooth headsets, mice, Xbox/PlayStation controllers, and Logitech/Razer gear.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-ql">
            <div class="ql-box"><span class="ql-s" set:html={icons.search} /><span>term</span><i class="ql-caret"></i></div>
            <div class="ql-r on"><span class="ql-i" set:html={appIcons.terminal} /><span><b>Terminal</b><small>App</small></span></div>
            <div class="ql-r"><span class="ql-i ql-d" set:html={icons.settings} /><span><b>Turn on auto-hide</b><small>DockHub command</small></span></div>
            <div class="ql-r"><span class="ql-i ql-d" set:html={icons.copy} /><span><b>= 30</b><small>200*15% · Enter copies</small></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="keys-row">
            <kbd class="k k-win" set:html={icons.windows} /><span class="k-plus">+</span><kbd class="k">Alt</kbd><span class="k-plus">+</span><kbd class="k">Space</kbd>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Quick launcher, Spotlight style.</h3>
          <p>
            Type to find apps, open windows, DockHub and system settings, recent files, and dock commands. It does quick math, unit and currency conversions, or searches the web on Enter. Open it with Win + Alt + Space (or ⌘⌥Space).
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw reveal">
        <div class="nw-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mock-profiles">
            <span class="mp"><i style="--c:var(--c-blue)"></i>Work</span>
            <span class="mp on"><i style="--c:var(--c-green)"></i>Gaming</span>
            <span class="mp"><i style="--c:var(--c-orange)"></i>Laptop</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-rules">
            <span><b>steam</b> is running → Gaming</span>
            <span>Weekdays 09:00 to 18:00 → Work</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Profiles that switch automatically.</h3>
          <p>Bring in your gaming dock while a game runs, or your work dock during office hours. When the app closes or the hours end, DockHub goes back.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="nw nw-full nw-fixes reveal">
        <div class="nw-copy">
          <h3>Complete cross-platform parity in v1.0.</h3>
          <p>Every feature refined, tested, and aligned across Windows and macOS.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="fixes">
          <li><span class="fx-ok" set:html={icons.check} /><span><b>Unified config.json.</b> Shared settings schema between Windows and macOS with automatic daily backups and instant Undo (Ctrl+Z / ⌘Z).</span></li>
          <li><span class="fx-ok" set:html={icons.check} /><span><b>Four languages.</b> Complete interface localization in English, Turkish, German, and Spanish.</span></li>
          <li><span class="fx-ok" set:html={icons.check} /><span><b>Multi-monitor docks.</b> Put independent floating docks on every connected screen with per-monitor DPI scaling.</span></li>
          <li><span class="fx-ok" set:html={icons.check} /><span><b>Zero administrator privileges.</b> 100% safe user space execution. Explorer and Finder are never modified or injected.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="news-more reveal">
      <a class="btn btn-quiet" href={site.releaseUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Full v1.0.0 release notes<span class="btn-ic" set:html={icons.arrowRight} />
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .pill-new {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 30px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgb(76 194 255 / 0.1);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(76 194 255 / 0.28);
  }
  .news {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .nw {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .nw > *,
  .nw-art > * {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .nw-full {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }
  .nw-wide {
    grid-column: span 2;
    grid-template-rows: none;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .nw-copy h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .nw-copy p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .nw-copy a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .nw-art {
    min-height: 150px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    align-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 90% at 30% 0%, rgb(76 194 255 / 0.13), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.03), rgb(255 255 255 / 0.01));
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
  }

  .keys-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .k {
    min-width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font: 600 15px var(--font-ui);
    color: var(--text);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1), rgb(255 255 255 / 0.04));
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12),
      inset 0 -2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35);
  }
  .k-win :global(svg) {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  .mt-btn {
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  /* macos mock */
  .mock-mac {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    width: min(100%, 360px);
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgb(28 30 38 / 0.94);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1), 0 16px 32px -12px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.7);
  }
  .mac-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-inline: 4px;
  }
  .mac-dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .mac-dots i {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .md-r { background: #ff5f56; }
  .md-y { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .md-g { background: #27c93f; }
  .mac-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .mac-dock-preview {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.05);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
  }
  .mdp-item {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    display: grid;
  }
  .mdp-item :global(svg) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .mdp-sep {
    width: 1px;
    height: 18px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.2);
  }
  .mdp-w {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 550;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .mdp-w i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
  }
  .mac-badges {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .mac-badges span {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-3);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.04);
  }

  /* profiles */
  .mock-profiles {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.04);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .mp {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .mp i {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
  }
  .mp.on {
    color: var(--text);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.09);
  }
  .mock-auto {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .mock-auto b {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  /* tray */
  .mock-tray {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgb(28 30 38 / 0.85);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.09);
    margin-top: 44px;
  }
  .tr-ic {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .tr-ic :global(svg) {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
  }
  .tr-vol {
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
  }
  .tr-tip {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: calc(100% + 8px);
    translate: -50% 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1px;
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    font-size: 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: rgb(44 46 54 / 0.97);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
  }
  .tr-tip small {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  /* quick launcher */
  .mock-ql {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3px;
    width: min(100%, 340px);
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgb(32 34 42 / 0.94);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1),
      0 16px 34px -14px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.9);
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
  .ql-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 32px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.06);
    box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 var(--accent);
  }
  .ql-s,
  .ql-i {
    display: grid;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .ql-i {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
  }
  .ql-d {
    padding: 3px;
  }
  .ql-s :global(svg),
  .ql-i :global(svg) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .ql-caret {
    width: 1px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--text);
    animation: ql-blink 1s steps(1) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes ql-blink {
    50% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  .ql-r {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .ql-r span:last-child {
    display: grid;
  }
  .ql-r b {
    font-weight: 560;
  }
  .ql-r small {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .ql-r.on {
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
    box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent);
  }
  .k-plus {
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  /* maximized window */
  .mock-max {
    width: min(100%, 230px);
    height: 118px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 6px 26px;
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #3a4a7a, #1b2238);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .mm-win {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 5px 7px;
    border-radius: 5px 5px 2px 2px;
    background: rgb(240 242 248 / 0.92);
  }
  .mm-win i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25);
  }
  .mm-gap {
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgb(76 194 255 / 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .mm-dock {
    margin-inline: 22px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgb(28 30 38 / 0.8);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12);
  }

  /* tray indicators */
  .tr-lang {
    width: auto;
    padding: 0 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .tr-mic {
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
  }
  .tr-clock {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 0 6px 0 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .tr-clock b {
    position: absolute;
    top: -3px;
    left: -3px;
    min-width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  /* profile rules */
  .mock-rules {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    justify-items: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .mock-rules b {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  /* new widgets */
  .mock-widgets {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    max-width: 300px;
  }
  .mock-widgets span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.05);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }
  .mock-widgets span::before {
    content: '';
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c);
  }

  /* previews */
  .mock-peek {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .pk-thumb {
    position: relative;
    width: 96px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 6px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: rgb(36 38 46 / 0.9);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
  }
  .pk-thumb i {
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #e9edf5, #b9c3d6);
  }
  .pk-thumb.on {
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--accent);
  }
  .pk-thumb.on i {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f7b267, #6a2c70);
  }
  .pk-thumb b {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10px;
    top: 26px;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #111;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92);
  }
  .pk-thumb b :global(svg) {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
  }

  /* link install */
  .mock-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: min(100%, 330px);
    padding: 6px 6px 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgb(36 38 46 / 0.92);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1);
  }
  .ml-url {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font: 11.5px 'Cascadia Code', Consolas, ui-monospace, monospace;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  /* fixes */
  .nw-fixes {
    grid-template-columns: none;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .fixes {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px 24px;
  }
  .fixes li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .fixes b {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .fx-ok {
    flex: none;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: #062a12;
    background: var(--c-green);
  }
  .fx-ok :global(svg) {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
  }
  .news-more {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .news {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .nw-wide,
    .nw-full {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .news {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .nw-wide,
    .nw-fixes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: none;
    }
    .fixes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .nw {
      padding: 16px;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ql-caret {
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
